<title>LATVIA: SHARES STAY IN NARROW RANGE, UNIBANKA EDGES UP.</title>
<headline>SHARES STAY IN NARROW RANGE, UNIBANKA EDGES UP.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
